 one thinking trap can exist in the same situation. The goal is not to label yourself; it is to identify what may be distorting the decision.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"prompt\":\"Answer these questions before deciding what the situation means:\\n• What facts do you know for certain?\\n• What assumptions are you making?\\n• What evidence supports your conclusion?\\n• What evidence challenges it?\\n• What information is still missing?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What facts do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What assumptions are you making?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your conclusion?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence challenges it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. What information is still missing?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"There is no reply yet.\",\"I do not know why they have not replied.\",\"The usual response time has passed, but that does not establish the reason.\",\"I do not know whether another decision-maker is involved.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"There is no reply yet.\",\"I do not know why they have not replied.\",\"The usual response time has passed, but that does not establish the reason.\",\"I do not know whether another decision-maker is involved.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":4}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"They are reviewing it internally.\",\"A decision-maker is unavailable.\",\"The proposal requires budget approval.\",\"Their priorities changed temporarily.\",\"They may still intend to respond.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"They are reviewing it internally.\",\"A decision-maker is unavailable.\",\"The proposal requires budget approval.\",\"Their priorities changed temporarily.\",\"They may still intend to respond.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Send one concise follow-up.\",\"Set a reasonable follow-up point rather than checking repeatedly.\",\"Continue progressing other opportunities instead of treating this client as either won or lost.\"],\"reference_example\":\"Send one concise follow-up.\\nSet a reasonable follow-up point rather than checking repeatedly.\\nContinue progressing other opportunities instead of treating this client as either won or lost.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"I can respond to what I know without inventing the part I don\'t know.\",\"reference_example\":\"I can respond to what I know without inventing the part I don\'t know.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"When someone is silent, how quickly do you decide what their silence means?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment to reflect on today\'s scenario.\",\"required\":false}}}', `updated_at` = '2026-11-10 12:00:00';

INSERT INTO `foundation_days` (`day_number`, `phase`, `title`, `domain`, `primary_trap`, `secondary_trap`, `content_bundle`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
VALUES (23, 2, 'The New Leadership', 'Workplace', 'Fortune Telling', 'Catastrophizing, Mind Reading', '{\"day\":23,\"phase\":2,\"title\":\"The New Leadership\",\"domain\":\"Workplace\",\"mission\":\"A change in leadership is not automatically a threat.\",\"learning_objective\":\"Recognize Thinking Traps\",\"difficulty\":\"Intermediate\",\"emotional_intensity\":\"Moderate\",\"estimated_minutes\":\"4-6\",\"primary_skill\":\"Decode\",\"primary_trap\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"secondary_trap\":\"Catastrophizing, Mind Reading\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Catastrophizing\",\"Mind Reading\"],\"guidance_level\":\"Moderate guidance; user is still explicitly prompted through each step.\",\"interaction_principle\":\"Think → Commit → Compare → Reflect\",\"scenario_text\":\"Your department gets a new manager.\\nYou have heard that the new manager is demanding.\\nTwo colleagues say the team will probably be reorganized.\\nNothing has been announced.\\nYou begin thinking your role may disappear and start considering leaving immediately.\",\"steps\":[{\"step_number\":1,\"key\":\"detect\",\"prompt\":\"Write only the facts. Then write the story your mind is creating.\",\"insight\":\"Facts describe what is known. The story explains what the mind thinks the facts mean.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"facts\",\"prompt\":\"Write only the facts.\",\"multiline\":true},{\"field_key\":\"story\",\"prompt\":\"Now write the story/assumptions your mind is creating.\",\"multiline\":true}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":{\"facts\":[\"A new manager has joined.\",\"You have heard that the manager is demanding.\",\"Colleagues have speculated about a reorganization.\",\"No change to your role has been announced.\"],\"story\":\"My role is probably going to disappear, so I should leave before it happens.\"},\"reference_example\":\"Fact: A new manager has joined. You have heard that the manager is demanding. Colleagues have speculated about a reorganization. No change to your role has been announced.\\nStory: My role is probably going to disappear, so I should leave before it happens.\"},{\"step_number\":2,\"key\":\"decode\",\"prompt\":\"Which thinking trap(s) may be influencing your judgment? Select the one you think is primary and note any others.\",\"input_type\":\"single_choice_with_multi_notes\",\"options\":[{\"key\":\"mind_reading\",\"label\":\"Mind Reading\",\"definition\":\"Assuming others\' intentions without evidence.\"},{\"key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"label\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"definition\":\"Treating an unverified prediction as certain.\"},{\"key\":\"emotional_reasoning\",\"label\":\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"definition\":\"Treating a feeling as proof of reality.\"},{\"key\":\"catastrophizing\",\"label\":\"Catastrophizing\",\"definition\":\"Assuming the absolute worst outcome.\"},{\"key\":\"confirmation_bias\",\"label\":\"Confirmation Bias\",\"definition\":\"Only seeing details that confirm the feared story.\"},{\"key\":\"rumination\",\"label\":\"Rumination\",\"definition\":\"Repetitive, circular overthinking of past events.\"},{\"key\":\"all_or_nothing\",\"label\":\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\",\"definition\":\"Treating a minor gap as total failure or framing as either-or.\"},{\"key\":\"validation_seeking\",\"label\":\"Validation Seeking\",\"definition\":\"Allowing external approval to define self-worth or decisions.\"},{\"key\":\"sunk_cost_fallacy\",\"label\":\"Sunk Cost Fallacy\",\"definition\":\"Continuing a path solely because of past unrecoverable investment.\"}],\"correct_option_key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"primary_trap\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Catastrophizing\",\"Mind Reading\"],\"secondary_trap_keys\":[\"catastrophizing\",\"mind_reading\"],\"explanation_reveal\":\"after_commit\",\"explanation\":\"Fortune Telling turns speculation into a future outcome. Catastrophizing and Mind Reading may add a worst-case interpretation of the new manager\'s intentions.\\nRemember: More than one thinking trap can exist in the same situation. The goal is not to label yourself; it is to identify what may be distorting the decision.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"prompt\":\"Answer these questions before deciding what the situation means:\\n• What facts do you know for certain?\\n• What assumptions are you making?\\n• What evidence supports your conclusion?\\n• What evidence challenges it?\\n• What information is still missing?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What facts do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What assumptions are you making?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your conclusion?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence challenges it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. What information is still missing?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"No role change has been announced.\",\"The source of the reorganization information is informal.\",\"I have no evidence that my position will disappear.\",\"I have not yet worked with the new manager.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"No role change has been announced.\",\"The source of the reorganization information is informal.\",\"I have no evidence that my position will disappear.\",\"I have not yet worked with the new manager.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":4}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"The new manager may improve the team without restructuring it.\",\"The manager may reorganize some responsibilities but not my role.\",\"The rumors may be inaccurate.\",\"Changes may create new responsibilities rather than remove existing ones.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"The new manager may improve the team without restructuring it.\",\"The manager may reorganize some responsibilities but not my role.\",\"The rumors may be inaccurate.\",\"Changes may create new responsibilities rather than remove existing ones.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Observe the first few weeks and gather direct information.\",\"Clarify expectations with the new manager.\",\"Do not resign solely because of speculation.\"],\"reference_example\":\"Observe the first few weeks and gather direct information.\\nClarify expectations with the new manager.\\nDo not resign solely because of speculation.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"A possibility becomes a fact only when evidence supports it.\",\"reference_example\":\"A possibility becomes a fact only when evidence supports it.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"Where do you treat other people\'s predictions as if they were information?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment to reflect on today\'s scenario.\",\"required\":false}}}', '2026-11-10 12:00:00', '2026-11-10 12:00:00')
