bout a reorganization. No change to your role has been announced.\\nStory: My role is probably going to disappear, so I should leave before it happens.\"},{\"step_number\":2,\"key\":\"decode\",\"prompt\":\"Which thinking trap(s) may be influencing your judgment? Select the one you think is primary and note any others.\",\"input_type\":\"single_choice_with_multi_notes\",\"options\":[{\"key\":\"mind_reading\",\"label\":\"Mind Reading\",\"definition\":\"Assuming others\' intentions without evidence.\"},{\"key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"label\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"definition\":\"Treating an unverified prediction as certain.\"},{\"key\":\"emotional_reasoning\",\"label\":\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"definition\":\"Treating a feeling as proof of reality.\"},{\"key\":\"catastrophizing\",\"label\":\"Catastrophizing\",\"definition\":\"Assuming the absolute worst outcome.\"},{\"key\":\"confirmation_bias\",\"label\":\"Confirmation Bias\",\"definition\":\"Only seeing details that confirm the feared story.\"},{\"key\":\"rumination\",\"label\":\"Rumination\",\"definition\":\"Repetitive, circular overthinking of past events.\"},{\"key\":\"all_or_nothing\",\"label\":\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\",\"definition\":\"Treating a minor gap as total failure or framing as either-or.\"},{\"key\":\"validation_seeking\",\"label\":\"Validation Seeking\",\"definition\":\"Allowing external approval to define self-worth or decisions.\"},{\"key\":\"sunk_cost_fallacy\",\"label\":\"Sunk Cost Fallacy\",\"definition\":\"Continuing a path solely because of past unrecoverable investment.\"}],\"correct_option_key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"primary_trap\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Catastrophizing\",\"Mind Reading\"],\"secondary_trap_keys\":[\"catastrophizing\",\"mind_reading\"],\"explanation_reveal\":\"after_commit\",\"explanation\":\"Fortune Telling turns speculation into a future outcome. Catastrophizing and Mind Reading may add a worst-case interpretation of the new manager\'s intentions.\\nRemember: More than one thinking trap can exist in the same situation. The goal is not to label yourself; it is to identify what may be distorting the decision.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"prompt\":\"Answer these questions before deciding what the situation means:\\n• What facts do you know for certain?\\n• What assumptions are you making?\\n• What evidence supports your conclusion?\\n• What evidence challenges it?\\n• What information is still missing?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What facts do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What assumptions are you making?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your conclusion?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence challenges it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. What information is still missing?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"No role change has been announced.\",\"The source of the reorganization information is informal.\",\"I have no evidence that my position will disappear.\",\"I have not yet worked with the new manager.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"No role change has been announced.\",\"The source of the reorganization information is informal.\",\"I have no evidence that my position will disappear.\",\"I have not yet worked with the new manager.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":4}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"The new manager may improve the team without restructuring it.\",\"The manager may reorganize some responsibilities but not my role.\",\"The rumors may be inaccurate.\",\"Changes may create new responsibilities rather than remove existing ones.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"The new manager may improve the team without restructuring it.\",\"The manager may reorganize some responsibilities but not my role.\",\"The rumors may be inaccurate.\",\"Changes may create new responsibilities rather than remove existing ones.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Observe the first few weeks and gather direct information.\",\"Clarify expectations with the new manager.\",\"Do not resign solely because of speculation.\"],\"reference_example\":\"Observe the first few weeks and gather direct information.\\nClarify expectations with the new manager.\\nDo not resign solely because of speculation.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"A possibility becomes a fact only when evidence supports it.\",\"reference_example\":\"A possibility becomes a fact only when evidence supports it.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"Where do you treat other people\'s predictions as if they were information?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment to reflect on today\'s scenario.\",\"required\":false}}}', `updated_at` = '2026-11-10 12:00:00';

INSERT INTO `foundation_days` (`day_number`, `phase`, `title`, `domain`, `primary_trap`, `secondary_trap`, `content_bundle`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
VALUES (24, 2, 'The Uncomfortable Feedback', 'Career', 'Emotional Reasoning', 'Validation Seeking, All-or-Nothing Thinking', '{\"day\":24,\"phase\":2,\"title\":\"The Uncomfortable Feedback\",\"domain\":\"Career\",\"mission\":\"Feedback can be uncomfortable without being a verdict.\",\"learning_objective\":\"Test Assumptions with Evidence\",\"difficulty\":\"Intermediate\",\"emotional_intensity\":\"Moderate\",\"estimated_minutes\":\"4-6\",\"primary_skill\":\"Reality Check\",\"primary_trap\":\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"secondary_trap\":\"Validation Seeking, All-or-Nothing Thinking\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Validation Seeking\",\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\"],\"guidance_level\":\"Moderate guidance; user is still explicitly prompted through each step.\",\"interaction_principle\":\"Think → Commit → Compare → Reflect\",\"scenario_text\":\"Your manager says, “There are some areas where I need to see improvement.”\\nYou feel embarrassed.\\nThe manager also says your technical work is strong.\\nYou hear only the criticism and leave thinking your performance is poor.\\nYou begin wondering whether you are simply not good enough for the role.\",\"steps\":[{\"step_number\":1,\"key\":\"detect\",\"prompt\":\"Write only the facts. Then write the story your mind is creating.\",\"insight\":\"Facts describe what is known. The story explains what the mind thinks the facts mean.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"facts\",\"prompt\":\"Write only the facts.\",\"multiline\":true},{\"field_key\":\"story\",\"prompt\":\"Now write the story/assumptions your mind is creating.\",\"multiline\":true}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":{\"facts\":[\"Your manager identified areas for improvement.\",\"Your manager also said your technical work is strong.\",\"You felt embarrassed during the conversation.\",\"No statement was made that you are failing overall.\"],\"story\":\"If my manager is dissatisfied with part of my performance, I\'m not good enough for this role.\"},\"reference_example\":\"Fact: Your manager identified areas for improvement. Your manager also said your technical work is strong. You felt embarrassed during the conversation. No statement was made that you are failing overall.\\nStory: If my manager is dissatisfied with part of my performance, I\'m not good enough for this role.\"},{\"step_number\":2,\"key\":\"decode\",\"prompt\":\"Which thinking trap(s) may be influencing your judgment? Select the one you think is primary and note any others.\",\"input_type\":\"single_choice_with_multi_notes\",\"options\":[{\"key\":\"mind_reading\",\"label\":\"Mind Reading\",\"definition\":\"Assuming others\' intentions without evidence.\"},{\"key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"label\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"definition\":\"Treating an unverified prediction as certain.\"},{\"key\":\"emotional_reasoning\",\"label\":\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"definition\":\"Treating a feeling as proof of reality.\"},{\"key\":\"catastrophizing\",\"label\":\"Catastrophizing\",\"definition\":\"Assuming the absolute worst outcome.\"},{\"key\":\"confirmation_bias\",\"label\":\"Confirmation Bias\",\"definition\":\"Only seeing details that confirm the feared story.\"},{\"key\":\"rumination\",\"label\":\"Rumination\",\"definition\":\"Repetitive, circular overthinking of past events.\"},{\"key\":\"all_or_nothing\",\"label\":\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\",\"definition\":\"Treating a minor gap as total failure or framing as either-or.\"},{\"key\":\"validation_seeking\",\"label\":\"Validation Seeking\",\"definition\":\"Allowing external approval to define self-worth or decisions.\"},{\"key\":\"sunk_cost_fallacy\",\"label\":\"Sunk Cost Fallacy\",\"definition\":\"Continuing a path solely because of past unrecoverable investment.\"}],\"correct_option_key\":\"emotional_reasoning\",\"primary_trap\":\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Validation Seeking\",\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\"],\"secondary_trap_keys\":[\"validation_seeking\",\"all_or_nothing\"],\"explanation_reveal\":\"after_commit\",\"explanation\":\"Emotional Reasoning turns embarrassment into evidence. Validation Seeking makes feedback feel like a judgment of worth. All-or-Nothing Thinking can convert one area for improvement into total failure.\\nRemember: More than one thinking trap can exist in the same situation. The goal is not to label yourself; it is to identify what may be distorting the decision.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"prompt\":\"Answer these questions before deciding what the situation means:\\n• What facts do you know for certain?\\n• What assumptions are you making?\\n• What evidence supports your conclusion?\\n• What evidence challenges it?\\n• What information is still missing?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What facts do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What assumptions are you making?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your conclusion?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence challenges it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. What information is still missing?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"I received both positive and corrective feedback.\",\"I do not know how serious the gaps are until I clarify them.\",\"Feeling embarrassed does not establish poor performance.\",\"The manager did not say I am failing.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"I received both positive and corrective feedback.\",\"I do not know how serious the gaps are until I clarify them.\",\"Feeling embarrassed does not establish poor performance.\",\"The manager did not say I am failing.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":4}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"The manager expects growth at my level.\",\"The gaps may be specific and fixable.\",\"The feedback may be preparation for greater responsibility.\",\"The manager may be giving useful information early.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"The manager expects growth at my level.\",\"The gaps may be specific and fixable.\",\"The feedback may be preparation for greater responsibility.\",\"The manager may be giving useful information early.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Ask for two or three specific examples.\",\"Agree on what improvement would look like.\",\"Review progress after an agreed period.\"],\"reference_example\":\"Ask for two or three specific examples.\\nAgree on what improvement would look like.\\nReview progress after an agreed period.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"Feedback about one part of my performance is information—not a verdict on my entire capability.\",\"reference_example\":\"Feedback about one part of my performance is information—not a verdict on my entire capability.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"When feedback hurts, do you evaluate the evidence or the feeling first?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment to reflect on today\'s scenario.\",\"required\":false}}}', '2026-11-10 12:00:00', '2026-11-10 12:00:00')
