 focus on evidence supporting the deal. Sunk Cost makes past effort feel like a reason to continue. Fortune Telling predicts a successful outcome without sufficient evidence.\\nRemember: More than one thinking trap can exist in the same situation. The goal is not to label yourself; it is to identify what may be distorting the decision.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"prompt\":\"Answer these questions before deciding what the situation means:\\n• What facts do you know for certain?\\n• What assumptions are you making?\\n• What evidence supports your conclusion?\\n• What evidence challenges it?\\n• What information is still missing?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What facts do you know for certain?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What assumptions are you making?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q3\",\"prompt\":\"3. What evidence supports your conclusion?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q4\",\"prompt\":\"4. What evidence challenges it?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q5\",\"prompt\":\"5. What information is still missing?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Past effort cannot be recovered.\",\"The commercial terms have changed.\",\"The deal is not yet committed.\",\"The new economics need to be evaluated from today\'s position.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"Past effort cannot be recovered.\",\"The commercial terms have changed.\",\"The deal is not yet committed.\",\"The new economics need to be evaluated from today\'s position.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"alt_explanations\",\"prompt\":\"Write at least four other explanations or perspectives that also fit the facts.\",\"type\":\"multi_entry\",\"min_entries\":4}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"The revised deal may still be profitable.\",\"The client may accept a different structure.\",\"The deal may need to be renegotiated.\",\"Walking away may preserve resources for better opportunities.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"The revised deal may still be profitable.\",\"The client may accept a different structure.\",\"The deal may need to be renegotiated.\",\"Walking away may preserve resources for better opportunities.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"Based on the evidence available today, what is the most reasonable next action?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Recalculate the economics using the new terms.\",\"Compare the revised deal with realistic alternatives.\",\"Continue only if the future value justifies the remaining effort.\"],\"reference_example\":\"Recalculate the economics using the new terms.\\nCompare the revised deal with realistic alternatives.\\nContinue only if the future value justifies the remaining effort.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"Complete the sentence: “Today I learned that…”\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"A decision should be based on what the opportunity is worth now—not on how much I have already invested.\",\"reference_example\":\"A decision should be based on what the opportunity is worth now—not on how much I have already invested.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"Where might you be defending a past decision instead of reassessing the future?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment 