 a capability problem, a motivation problem and a temporary personal difficulty?\\n• What responsibilities does the organisation have towards the employee and the wider team?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What evidence would help distinguish a capability problem, a motivation problem and a temporary personal difficulty?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. What responsibilities does the organisation have towards the employee and the wider team?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Historical performance trends.\",\"Current role requirements.\",\"Quality and timeliness of deliverables.\",\"Training and coaching records.\",\"Feedback from colleagues.\",\"Whether targets are realistic.\",\"Workload and resource availability.\",\"Employee feedback and support requirements.\",\"Applicable employment policies and legal obligations.\",\"Fairness requires considering the employee\'s circumstances without ignoring the impact on others.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"Historical performance trends.\",\"Current role requirements.\",\"Quality and timeliness of deliverables.\",\"Training and coaching records.\",\"Feedback from colleagues.\",\"Whether targets are realistic.\",\"Workload and resource availability.\",\"Employee feedback and support requirements.\",\"Applicable employment policies and legal obligations.\",\"Fairness requires considering the employee\'s circumstances without ignoring the impact on others.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Explore other explanations and alternatives:\\n• What alternatives exist apart from continuing the current arrangement or immediately terminating employment?\\n• How could the role or support structure be redesigned to give the employee a reasonable opportunity to improve?\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What alternatives exist apart from continuing the current arrangement or immediately terminating employment?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. How could the role or support structure be redesigned to give the employee a reasonable opportunity to improve?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Formal performance improvement plan.\",\"Temporary adjustment of responsibilities.\",\"Additional training.\",\"Role reassignment where appropriate.\",\"Defined support and review period.\",\"Mutual separation where suitable.\",\"Formal termination if reasonable support fails and the performance gap remains material.\",\"Compassion does not require eliminating accountability.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"Formal performance improvement plan.\",\"Temporary adjustment of responsibilities.\",\"Additional training.\",\"Role reassignment where appropriate.\",\"Defined support and review period.\",\"Mutual separation where suitable.\",\"Formal termination if reasonable support fails and the performance gap remains material.\",\"Compassion does not require eliminating accountability.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"What would you communicate to the employee, and how would you determine whether improvement is sufficient?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"What would you communicate to the employee, and how would you determine whether improvement is sufficient?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Conducting a documented performance review.\",\"Clearly communicating expectations.\",\"Understanding the employee\'s concerns.\",\"Defining achievable performance targets.\",\"Providing reasonable support.\",\"Setting review dates.\",\"Following a fair and consistent HR process.\",\"Avoid making employment decisions based solely on frustration or guilt.\"],\"reference_example\":\"Conducting a documented performance review.\\nClearly communicating expectations.\\nUnderstanding the employee\'s concerns.\\nDefining achievable performance targets.\\nProviding reasonable support.\\nSetting review dates.\\nFollowing a fair and consistent HR process.\\nAvoid making employment decisions based solely on frustration or guilt.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"What judgment principle will you take away from this situation?\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"What judgment principle will you take away from this situation?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"Good leadership combines empathy with accountability. Fair treatment means providing appropriate support while maintaining reasonable standards for everyone.\",\"reference_example\":\"Good leadership combines empathy with accountability. Fair treatment means providing appropriate support while maintaining reasonable standards for everyone.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"When does protecting one employee from difficult feedback become unfair to the rest of the team?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment to reflect on today\'s scenario.\",\"required\":false}}}', `updated_at` = '2026-11-10 12:00:00';

INSERT INTO `foundation_days` (`day_number`, `phase`, `title`, `domain`, `primary_trap`, `secondary_trap`, `content_bundle`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
VALUES (55, 3, 'The Opportunity That Requires You to Compete with Your Current Employer', 'Workplace / Entrepreneurship / Professional Ethics', 'Fortune Telling', 'Emotional Reasoning, Confirmation Bias, All-or-Nothing Thinking', '{\"day\":55,\"phase\":3,\"title\":\"The Opportunity That Requires You to Compete with Your Current Employer\",\"domain\":\"Workplace / Entrepreneurship / Professional Ethics\",\"mission\":\"A professional opportunity should be evaluated without compromising confidentiality, trust or existing obligations.\",\"learning_objective\":\"Recognise conflicts of interest, distinguish legitimate career development from competing obligations and protect professional integrity.\",\"difficulty\":\"Advanced\",\"emotional_intensity\":\"High\",\"estimated_minutes\":\"6-8\",\"primary_skill\":\"Evaluate\",\"primary_trap\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"secondary_trap\":\"Emotional Reasoning, Confirmation Bias, All-or-Nothing Thinking\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"Confirmation Bias\",\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\"],\"guidance_level\":\"Moderate to high guidance; strategic leadership, financial risk and long-term consequences.\",\"interaction_principle\":\"Think → Commit → Compare → Reflect\",\"scenario_text\":\"You are a senior executive in a healthcare services company.\\nOver the last four years, you have developed strong relationships with hospitals, doctors, vendors and institutional clients.\\nYou have now been approached by an investor who wants you to start a competing healthcare consultancy.\\nThe investor is willing to provide initial capital and a significant equity stake.\\nYou believe the opportunity has considerable potential because you understand the market and have identified several unmet needs.\\nHowever, your current employer has invested in your professional development and given you access to confidential commercial information.\\nSome of the potential clients are also existing customers of your employer.\\nThe investor wants you to start discussions immediately and believes that your industry relationships will help acquire customers.\\nYou are attracted to entrepreneurship but do not want to damage your professional reputation or expose yourself to legal consequences.\\nYou must decide whether to accept the opportunity, negotiate a different structure, wait until your employment ends or decline.\",\"steps\":[{\"step_number\":1,\"key\":\"detect\",\"prompt\":\"What are the confirmed facts, and what are you assuming about your right to pursue the opportunity?\",\"insight\":\"Facts describe what is known. Assumptions explain what the mind projects or fears.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"facts\",\"prompt\":\"Write only the confirmed facts.\",\"multiline\":true},{\"field_key\":\"assumptions\",\"prompt\":\"Write what you are assuming about this situation.\",\"multiline\":true}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":{\"facts\":[\"You are currently employed in a senior position.\",\"An investor has offered an entrepreneurial opportunity.\",\"The proposed business competes with your employer.\",\"Some potential customers overlap.\",\"You have access to confidential business information.\"],\"assumptions\":[\"Your industry relationships automatically belong to you.\",\"The employer cannot restrict your entrepreneurial activities.\",\"Using existing contacts is commercially harmless.\",\"The opportunity will disappear if you wait.\",\"Personal ambition does not eliminate contractual, fiduciary or confidentiality obligations.\"]},\"reference_example\":\"Confirmed facts: You are currently employed in a senior position.; An investor has offered an entrepreneurial opportunity.; The proposed business competes with your employer.\\nAssumptions: Your industry relationships automatically belong to you.; The employer cannot restrict your entrepreneurial activities.; Using existing contacts is commercially harmless.\"},{\"step_number\":2,\"key\":\"decode\",\"prompt\":\"Which thinking trap(s) may be influencing your judgment, and why?\",\"input_type\":\"single_choice_with_multi_notes\",\"options\":[{\"key\":\"mind_reading\",\"label\":\"Mind Reading\",\"definition\":\"Assuming others\' intentions without evidence.\"},{\"key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"label\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"definition\":\"Treating an unverified prediction as certain.\"},{\"key\":\"emotional_reasoning\",\"label\":\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"definition\":\"Treating a feeling as proof of reality.\"},{\"key\":\"catastrophizing\",\"label\":\"Catastrophizing\",\"definition\":\"Assuming the absolute worst outcome.\"},{\"key\":\"confirmation_bias\",\"label\":\"Confirmation Bias\",\"definition\":\"Only seeing details that confirm the feared story.\"},{\"key\":\"rumination\",\"label\":\"Rumination\",\"definition\":\"Repetitive, circular overthinking of past events.\"},{\"key\":\"all_or_nothing\",\"label\":\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\",\"definition\":\"Treating a minor gap as total failure or framing as either-or.\"},{\"key\":\"validation_seeking\",\"label\":\"Validation Seeking\",\"definition\":\"Allowing external approval to define self-worth or decisions.\"},{\"key\":\"sunk_cost_fallacy\",\"label\":\"Sunk Cost Fallacy\",\"definition\":\"Continuing a path solely because of past unrecoverable investment.\"}],\"correct_option_key\":\"fortune_telling\",\"primary_trap\":\"Fortune Telling\",\"secondary_traps\":[\"Emotional Reasoning\",\"Confirmation Bias\",\"All-or-Nothing Thinking\"],\"secondary_trap_keys\":[\"emotional_reasoning\",\"confirmation_bias\",\"all_or_nothing\"],\"explanation_reveal\":\"after_commit\",\"explanation\":\"Primary Thinking Trap: Fortune Telling\\nYou may be assuming that immediate acceptance is necessary because the opportunity may not remain available.\\nSecondary Thinking Traps:\\nEmotional Reasoning: Allowing excitement about entrepreneurship to minimise potential conflicts.\\nConfirmation Bias: Focusing on the opportunity while overlooking employment restrictions.\\nAll-or-Nothing Thinking: Assuming you must either accept immediately or abandon entrepreneurship completely.\"},{\"step_number\":3,\"key\":\"reality_check\",\"prompt\":\"Answer these questions before deciding what the situation means:\\n• What legal, contractual and commercial information should you review before proceeding?\\n• Which resources or relationships can you legitimately use, and which must remain with your current employer?\",\"tip\":\"Missing information is not evidence. Identify what you would need to know before becoming more certain.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What legal, contractual and commercial information should you review before proceeding?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. Which resources or relationships can you legitimately use, and which must remain with your current employer?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Relevant considerations include:\",\"Employment agreement.\",\"Confidentiality and intellectual property provisions.\",\"Conflict-of-interest policies.\",\"Non-solicitation obligations, where applicable.\",\"Fiduciary duties and applicable law.\",\"Ownership of business plans and work products.\",\"Source of the proposed customer relationships.\",\"Whether the proposed business can operate independently.\",\"Your professional experience is valuable. Your employer\'s confidential information is not yours to transfer.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"Relevant considerations include:\",\"Employment agreement.\",\"Confidentiality and intellectual property provisions.\",\"Conflict-of-interest policies.\",\"Non-solicitation obligations, where applicable.\",\"Fiduciary duties and applicable law.\",\"Ownership of business plans and work products.\",\"Source of the proposed customer relationships.\",\"Whether the proposed business can operate independently.\",\"Your professional experience is valuable. Your employer\'s confidential information is not yours to transfer.\"]},{\"step_number\":4,\"key\":\"reframe\",\"prompt\":\"Explore other explanations and alternatives:\\n• What alternatives exist beyond immediately starting the competing business or abandoning the opportunity?\\n• How could you pursue entrepreneurship without creating an avoidable conflict with your current employer?\",\"insight\":\"Reframing does not mean forcing a positive interpretation. It means expanding the set of explanations or options before deciding.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"q1\",\"prompt\":\"1. What alternatives exist beyond immediately starting the competing business or abandoning the opportunity?\"},{\"field_key\":\"q2\",\"prompt\":\"2. How could you pursue entrepreneurship without creating an avoidable conflict with your current employer?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"Negotiate a future joining or investment arrangement.\",\"Obtain appropriate written clearance where possible.\",\"Explore a non-competing business segment.\",\"Develop an independent business plan without using confidential information.\",\"Wait until employment obligations have been properly concluded.\",\"Decline the opportunity if the conflict cannot be responsibly resolved.\"],\"reference_example\":[\"Negotiate a future joining or investment arrangement.\",\"Obtain appropriate written clearance where possible.\",\"Explore a non-competing business segment.\",\"Develop an independent business plan without using confidential information.\",\"Wait until employment obligations have been properly concluded.\",\"Decline the opportunity if the conflict cannot be responsibly resolved.\"]},{\"step_number\":5,\"key\":\"intervention\",\"prompt\":\"What would you do before signing any agreement with the investor?\",\"reminder\":\"There isn\'t always a perfect action. There is usually a reasonable next action based on the evidence available.\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"action\",\"prompt\":\"What would you do before signing any agreement with the investor?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":[\"A responsible approach would include:\",\"Reviewing all employment obligations.\",\"Seeking independent legal advice.\",\"Disclosing conflicts where required.\",\"Separating personal business development from employer resources.\",\"Avoiding use of confidential information.\",\"Clarifying the investor\'s expectations.\",\"Establishing a legitimate transition plan.\",\"An entrepreneurial opportunity should not depend on the misuse of professional trust.\"],\"reference_example\":\"A responsible approach would include:\\nReviewing all employment obligations.\\nSeeking independent legal advice.\\nDisclosing conflicts where required.\\nSeparating personal business development from employer resources.\\nAvoiding use of confidential information.\\nClarifying the investor\'s expectations.\\nEstablishing a legitimate transition plan.\\nAn entrepreneurial opportunity should not depend on the misuse of professional trust.\"},{\"step_number\":6,\"key\":\"internalize\",\"prompt\":\"What judgment principle will you take away from this situation?\",\"inputs\":[{\"field_key\":\"principle\",\"prompt\":\"What judgment principle will you take away from this situation?\"}],\"thinkclear_thinking\":\"Professional ambition and ethical responsibility can coexist. The manner in which you leave one organisation matters as much as the opportunity you pursue next.\",\"reference_example\":\"Professional ambition and ethical responsibility can coexist. The manner in which you leave one organisation matters as much as the opportunity you pursue next.\"}],\"closing_reflection\":{\"prompt\":\"Would you be comfortable if your current employer used the same methods against you that you are considering using against them?\",\"journal_input\":{\"field_key\":\"journal\",\"prompt\":\"Optional reflection entry — take a moment to reflect on today\'s scenario.\",\"required\":false}}}', '2026-11-10 12:00:00', '2026-11-10 12:00:00')
